Z||000001||Philphine||11-10-2001||08:51 AM||||one i'm kinda thinking is a formula front with a gt rear. i think that front would let me lower the car the most without potential damage later. <P>it's the sides that would be a problem. it would need to be kind of streamlined behind the wheel like the front and flare out to match a gt rear. if irm scoops (and even the copies) weren't so expensive they'd be nice to experiment with. maybe cut away the front or trim it severly and by the time you get to the back of the door they are fully flared to match a gt back facia.<P>got other projects and little cash anyway, so i'm waiting to see what aus and ferrari momo come up with.<P>anyway thats sort of my vote. i just have to picture it on my car to work the idea.<P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>start where you are,<BR>use what you have,<BR>do what you can.||||reg||1
